The dynamic Silicon Labs Zigbee HAL (src/hal/zigbee*.h,
src/platform/zigbee.c, src/platform/ota.c) and initial SLC/ZAP configuration
are adapted from romasku/tuya-zigbee-switch, revision 8542fc05:
https://github.com/romasku/tuya-zigbee-switch
Its permission notice is preserved in LICENSES/tuya-zigbee-switch.txt. These files have been modified
for the configurable MCU bridge and Simplicity SDK 2025.6.2.

The Silicon Labs SDK, Zigbee stack libraries, compiler, and generation tools
are external dependencies with their own licenses. They are not included in
this repository. No Tuya stock firmware, network keys, or device backups are
included.
